# shadcn/ui for UI Elements

This project uses [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com) for all UI elements. Do not hand-roll UI primitives (buttons, inputs, dialogs, etc.) or pull in another component library — use shadcn/ui components instead.

## Initialization

Check for a `components.json` file at the project root to determine whether shadcn/ui has been initialized.

If it is **not** initialized, run this before adding any components:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest init
```

## Adding components

Components live under `src/components/ui`. Before using a shadcn/ui component, check whether it already exists there.

If the component is **not** yet installed, install it first. For example, to add the button component:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add button
```

Then import it from `src/components/ui` (e.g. `@/components/ui/button`) rather than redefining it.
